      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/bismarck_arkansas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Electricity reached Bismarck in 1938, modernizing farms and homes after decades of rural isolation.",
